   "start": 447.4,
   "end": 448.04,
   "text": "So..."
  },
  {
   "start": 448.04,
   "end": 449.8,
   "text": "I saw two people fall yesterday"
  },
  {
   "start": 449.8,
   "end": 451.0,
   "text": "On rocks."
  },
  {
   "start": 451.58,
   "end": 452.22,
   "text": "Um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 452.22,
   "end": 453.0,
   "text": "Tripping on the rocks."
  },
  {
   "start": 454.26,
   "end": 454.62,
   "text": "Um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 455.42,
   "end": 456.58,
   "text": "Yeah, I think my shirt"
  },
  {
   "start": 456.58,
   "end": 457.06,
   "text": "Was, like,"
  },
  {
   "start": 457.44,
   "end": 458.48,
   "text": "Freaking people out,"
  },
  {
   "start": 458.76,
   "end": 460.12,
   "text": "Because I have my fire shirt."
  },
  {
   "start": 460.32,
   "end": 461.8,
   "text": "It's, like, flame on my front."
  },
  {
   "start": 462.5,
   "end": 463.84,
   "text": "And I passed this one lady,"
  },
  {
   "start": 463.96,
   "end": 464.68,
   "text": "And then this other lady"
  },
  {
   "start": 464.68,
   "end": 465.6,
   "text": "Turned around and looked at me,"
  },
  {
   "start": 465.62,
   "end": 465.88,
   "text": "And goes,"
  },
  {
   "start": 466.0,
   "end": 466.48,
   "text": "Ah!"
  },
  {
   "start": 466.58,
   "end": 467.22,
   "text": "And fell down."
  },
  {
   "start": 468.06,
   "end": 469.02,
   "text": "And then there..."
  },
  {
   "start": 469.02,
   "end": 469.8,
   "text": "Where I was going up,"
  },
  {
   "start": 469.82,
   "end": 470.64,
   "text": "And this group of people"
  },
  {
   "start": 470.64,
   "end": 471.24,
   "text": "Were going down,"
  },
  {
   "start": 471.32,
   "end": 472.46,
   "text": "And they had this dog,"
  },
  {
   "start": 472.54,
   "end": 473.3,
   "text": "This big dog,"
  },
  {
   "start": 473.5,
   "end": 474.16,
   "text": "Like a collie,"
  },
  {
   "start": 474.22,
   "end": 474.96,
   "text": "And that was totally"
  },
  {
   "start": 474.96,
   "end": 475.72,
   "text": "Freaked out by me,"
  },
  {
   "start": 475.78,
   "end": 476.74,
   "text": "Like, running away from me."
  },
  {
   "start": 477.7,
   "end": 478.6,
   "text": "Then this other dude"
  },
  {
   "start": 478.6,
   "end": 479.34,
   "text": "Fell down, like,"
  },
  {
   "start": 479.36,
   "end": 480.26,
   "text": "Right when he saw me"
  },
  {
   "start": 480.26,
   "end": 481.38,
   "text": "Going down."
  },
  {
   "start": 481.38,
   "end": 483.34,
   "text": "And then this other dude"
  },
  {
   "start": 483.34,
   "end": 484.4,
   "text": "Going up had a Hawaiian shirt"
  },
  {
   "start": 484.4,
   "end": 484.92,
   "text": "And was like,"
  },
  {
   "start": 485.0,
   "end": 485.86,
   "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah."
  },
  {
   "start": 485.86,
   "end": 487.06,
   "text": "So..."
  },
  {
   "start": 487.06,
   "end": 488.3,
   "text": "I have a whole, like,"
  },
  {
   "start": 488.4,
   "end": 489.06,
   "text": "Fire..."
  },
  {
   "start": 489.06,
   "end": 489.78,
   "text": "Fire..."
  },
  {
   "start": 489.78,
   "end": 490.2,
   "text": "Uh-uh."
  },
  {
   "start": 490.94,
   "end": 492.04,
   "text": "I have three of those"
  },
  {
   "start": 492.04,
   "end": 492.62,
   "text": "Fire shirts."
  },
  {
   "start": 492.72,
   "end": 493.6,
   "text": "That was my big one"
  },
  {
   "start": 493.6,
   "end": 494.78,
   "text": "That I have two spy with."
  },
  {
   "start": 495.74,
   "end": 496.48,
   "text": "Yeah, yeah."
  },
  {
   "start": 496.48,
   "end": 498.54,
   "text": "I have a fire bike jersey, too."
  },
  {
   "start": 499.58,
   "end": 500.38,
   "text": "That says, uh,"
  },
  {
   "start": 500.38,
   "end": 501.62,
   "text": "Fat Bastard Cycling Team"
  },
  {
   "start": 501.62,
   "end": 502.02,
   "text": "On the back."
  },
  {
   "start": 503.3,
   "end": 504.5,
   "text": "With a bunch of hot dogs"
  },
  {
   "start": 504.5,
   "end": 505.58,
   "text": "Sticking out of the pockets."
  },
  {
   "start": 507.1,
   "end": 507.66,
   "text": "Um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 507.66,
   "end": 510.02,
   "text": "And then I have a red jersey"
  },
  {
   "start": 510.02,
   "end": 511.2,
   "text": "And my helmet's red."
  },
  {
   "start": 511.5,
   "end": 511.98,
   "text": "And my..."
  },
  {
   "start": 511.98,
   "end": 512.6,
   "text": "And my road..."
  },
  {
   "start": 512.6,
   "end": 514.34,
   "text": "My, uh..."
  },
  {
   "start": 514.34,
   "end": 515.4,
   "text": "Road bike is red"
  },
  {
   "start": 515.4,
   "end": 516.56,
   "text": "And my, uh..."
  },
  {
   "start": 516.56,
   "end": 517.78,
   "text": "Time trial bike is red"
  },
  {
   "start": 517.78,
   "end": 518.18,
   "text": "On the bottom"
  },
  {
   "start": 518.18,
   "end": 519.1,
   "text": "And yellow on the top."
  },
  {
   "start": 519.66,
   "end": 520.98,
   "text": "And I have a mountain bike"
  },
  {
   "start": 520.98,
   "end": 521.44,
   "text": "That's painted"
  },
  {
   "start": 521.44,
   "end": 523.1,
   "text": "Exactly like my time trial bike."
  },
  {
   "start": 523.66,
   "end": 524.1,
   "text": "A Klein."
  },
  {
   "start": 525.54,
   "end": 526.98,
   "text": "But, um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 526.98,
   "end": 530.98,
   "text": "But it was..."
  },
  {
   "start": 530.98,
   "end": 534.36,
   "text": "Yesterday was the second time"
  },
  {
   "start": 534.36,
   "end": 535.32,
   "text": "That I ever did a trip"
  },
  {
   "start": 535.32,
   "end": 536.42,
   "text": "With my new, um,"
  },
  {
   "start": 536.52,
   "end": 537.4,
   "text": "AirPod Pros."
  },
  {
   "start": 537.66,
   "end": 539.26,
   "text": "That cancel out the noise"
  },
  {
   "start": 539.26,
   "end": 540.28,
   "text": "And that was really badass."
  },
  {
   "start": 540.66,
   "end": 541.1,
   "text": "Um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 541.1,
   "end": 543.38,
   "text": "Yeah, there's so many"
  },
  {
   "start": 543.38,
   "end": 544.58,
   "text": "Different, like, playlists"
  },
  {
   "start": 544.58,
   "end": 546.54,
   "text": "I haven't done yet on it."
  },
  {
   "start": 546.62,
   "end": 547.54,
   "text": "So, that was..."
  },
  {
   "start": 547.54,
   "end": 548.52,
   "text": "The first time was when"
  },
  {
   "start": 548.52,
   "end": 549.36,
   "text": "I went on the bike ride."
  },
  {
   "start": 549.52,
   "end": 550.02,
   "text": "It was pretty cool"
  },
  {
   "start": 550.02,
   "end": 551.14,
   "text": "But it was super sketchy."
  },
  {
   "start": 551.16,
   "end": 551.98,
   "text": "I almost got hit by a car."
  },
  {
   "start": 552.78,
   "end": 553.92,
   "text": "Because I didn't hear it coming."
  },
  {
   "start": 554.24,
   "end": 555.42,
   "text": "You know, like I was..."
  },
  {
   "start": 555.42,
   "end": 557.24,
   "text": "I was going up 6th Street."
  },
  {
   "start": 558.18,
   "end": 560.18,
   "text": "Only like a block away from..."
  },
  {
   "start": 560.18,
   "end": 561.3,
   "text": "I was on the final block"
  },
  {
   "start": 561.3,
   "end": 562.74,
   "text": "Before you get to Baseline."
  },
  {
   "start": 563.38,
   "end": 564.4,
   "text": "So it's really steep"
  },
  {
   "start": 564.4,
   "end": 565.92,
   "text": "And the speed limit's like 25."
  },
  {
   "start": 566.74,
   "end": 568.12,
   "text": "And I was way over on the side"
  },
  {
   "start": 568.12,
   "end": 569.02,
   "text": "And, um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 569.02,
   "end": 569.56,
   "text": "I was riding"
  },
  {
   "start": 569.56,
   "end": 570.84,
   "text": "But I was so tired, you know,"
  },
  {
   "start": 570.88,
   "end": 571.82,
   "text": "That I did one of those"
  },
  {
   "start": 571.82,
   "end": 573.28,
   "text": "Like accidental lefts."
  },
  {
   "start": 573.64,
   "end": 574.38,
   "text": "Sudden lefts."
  },
  {
   "start": 574.6,
   "end": 575.26,
   "text": "I need to practice"
  },
  {
   "start": 575.26,
   "end": 576.5,
   "text": "To never ever do that."
  },
  {
   "start": 577.26,
   "end": 577.7,
   "text": "No matter where."
  },
  {
   "start": 577.78,
   "end": 578.74,
   "text": "Because then there was this like"
  },
  {
   "start": 578.74,
   "end": 581.86,
   "text": "Big white pickup"
  },
  {
   "start": 581.86,
   "end": 583.38,
   "text": "With tinted windows."
  },
  {
   "start": 583.54,
   "end": 584.16,
   "text": "Just zooms by"
  },
  {
   "start": 584.16,
   "end": 585.54,
   "text": "At like 40 miles an hour"
  },
  {
   "start": 585.54,
   "end": 586.5,
   "text": "Like right next to me."
  },
  {
   "start": 586.64,
   "end": 587.22,
   "text": "It was only like"
  },
  {
   "start": 587.22,
   "end": 587.88,
   "text": "Less than a foot."
  },
  {
   "start": 588.02,
   "end": 588.4,
   "text": "I was like,"
  },
  {
   "start": 588.44,
   "end": 588.98,
   "text": "Oh my god."
  },
  {
   "start": 588.98,
   "end": 591.48,
   "text": "That's what's gonna do it, man."
  },
  {
   "start": 591.62,
   "end": 592.8,
   "text": "That's when you get..."
  },
  {
   "start": 592.8,
   "end": 593.8,
   "text": "So I need to practice"
  },
  {
   "start": 593.8,
   "end": 594.86,
   "text": "To stay straight and ride"
  },
  {
   "start": 594.86,
   "end": 596.46,
   "text": "Ride right on the curb."
  },
  {
   "start": 597.1,
   "end": 598.58,
   "text": "And only ride on roads"
  },
  {
   "start": 598.58,
   "end": 600.38,
   "text": "With like really good, uh..."
  },
  {
   "start": 600.38,
   "end": 601.4,
   "text": "Huge shoulders"
  },
  {
   "start": 601.4,
   "end": 603.34,
   "text": "Unless I..."
  },
  {
   "start": 603.34,
   "end": 604.3,
   "text": "Unless I..."
  },
  {
   "start": 604.3,
   "end": 607.7,
   "text": "Turn noise cancellation off"
  },
  {
   "start": 607.7,
   "end": 608.26,
   "text": "And pause it"
  },
  {
   "start": 608.26,
   "end": 609.28,
   "text": "For bad sections."
  },
  {
   "start": 610.42,
   "end": 611.48,
   "text": "Because damn, dude."
  },
  {
   "start": 612.86,
   "end": 613.58,
   "text": "Um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 613.58,
   "end": 615.44,
   "text": "That's one cool better thing"
  },
  {
   "start": 615.44,
   "end": 616.3,
   "text": "About mountain biking."
  },
  {
   "start": 616.44,
   "end": 616.98,
   "text": "You don't have to worry about"
  },
  {
   "start": 616.98,
   "end": 617.96,
   "text": "Getting hit by a car."
  },
  {
   "start": 619.34,
   "end": 620.1,
   "text": "And, uh..."
  },
  {
   "start": 620.1,
   "end": 620.42,
   "text": "Running."
  },
  {
   "start": 621.96,
   "end": 622.52,
   "text": "So..."
  },
  {
   "start": 623.72,
   "end": 627.33,
   "text": "Um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 627.33,
   "end": 628.49,
   "text": "So, uh..."
  },
  {
   "start": 628.49,
   "end": 641.02,
   "text": "I came back"
  },
  {
   "start": 641.02,
   "end": 641.46,
   "text": "And, you know,"
  },
  {
   "start": 641.5,
   "end": 642.2,
   "text": "It was wasted."
  },
  {
   "start": 644.48,
   "end": 645.0,
   "text": "Um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 645.0,
   "end": 646.58,
   "text": "And I was going to stretch."
  },
  {
   "start": 646.76,
   "end": 648.24,
   "text": "I took the mattress"
  },
  {
   "start": 648.24,
   "end": 648.98,
   "text": "Out of my room"
  },
  {
   "start": 648.98,
   "end": 649.74,
   "text": "And I was gonna like"
  },
  {
   "start": 649.74,
   "end": 651.08,
   "text": "Totally organize my room"
  },
  {
   "start": 651.08,
   "end": 651.68,
   "text": "And pick it up"
  },
  {
   "start": 651.68,
   "end": 652.22,
   "text": "And stretch."
  },
  {
   "start": 652.38,
   "end": 652.92,
   "text": "But, um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 652.92,
   "end": 655.12,
   "text": "I wanted to kind of"
  },
  {
   "start": 655.12,
   "end": 655.96,
   "text": "Put..."
  },
  {
   "start": 655.96,
   "end": 657.74,
   "text": "I wanted to put my, uh..."
  },
  {
   "start": 657.74,
   "end": 660.4,
   "text": "You can see my"
  },
  {
   "start": 660.4,
   "end": 661.74,
   "text": "My light system here."
  },
  {
   "start": 661.82,
   "end": 662.08,
   "text": "Here."
  },
  {
   "start": 662.72,
   "end": 664.0,
   "text": "Uh..."
  },
  {
   "start": 664.0,
   "end": 664.74,
   "text": "All right, dirt."
  },
  {
   "start": 665.84,
   "end": 666.64,
   "text": "Um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 666.64,
   "end": 669.02,
   "text": "For the, you know,"
  },
  {
   "start": 669.06,
   "end": 669.92,
   "text": "The healing lights."
  },
  {
   "start": 670.3,
   "end": 671.34,
   "text": "But I wanted to"
  },
  {
   "start": 671.34,
   "end": 671.92,
   "text": "Stick it there."
  },
  {
   "start": 673.34,
   "end": 673.9,
   "text": "Uh..."
  },
  {
   "start": 673.9,
   "end": 675.92,
   "text": "But I didn't have, uh..."
  },
  {
   "start": 675.92,
   "end": 677.22,
   "text": "Velcro."
  },
  {
   "start": 677.54,
   "end": 680.0,
   "text": "So I had to drive to, um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 680.0,
   "end": 680.58,
   "text": "Home Depot"
  },
  {
   "start": 680.58,
   "end": 682.46,
   "text": "For like eight."
  },
  {
   "start": 684.22,
   "end": 685.02,
   "text": "And I bought"
  },
  {
   "start": 685.02,
   "end": 685.78,
   "text": "20 bucks worth."
  },
  {
   "start": 685.86,
   "end": 686.66,
   "text": "I got two packages"
  },
  {
   "start": 686.66,
   "end": 687.6,
   "text": "Of Velcro this time."
  },
  {
   "start": 687.68,
   "end": 688.48,
   "text": "Because I've been back there"
  },
  {
   "start": 688.48,
   "end": 688.96,
   "text": "So many times"
  },
  {
   "start": 688.96,
   "end": 689.54,
   "text": "To get more Velcro."
  },
  {
   "start": 689.66,
   "end": 690.46,
   "text": "I just want to stick Velcro"
  },
  {
   "start": 690.46,
   "end": 691.34,
   "text": "All over the place."
  },
  {
   "start": 692.54,
   "end": 693.6,
   "text": "Because that means like"
  },
  {
   "start": 693.6,
   "end": 694.42,
   "text": "The stuff you have"
  },
  {
   "start": 694.42,
   "end": 695.42,
   "text": "Like your phone"
  },
  {
   "start": 695.42,
   "end": 697.06,
   "text": "Or whatever."
  },
  {
   "start": 697.3,
   "end": 697.96,
   "text": "Like you can just"
  },
  {
   "start": 697.96,
   "end": 699.04,
   "text": "Stick it on the wall."
  },
  {
   "start": 700.0,
   "end": 700.7,
   "text": "Like wherever."
  },
  {
   "start": 702.46,
   "end": 702.98,
   "text": "Um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 702.98,
   "end": 705.74,
   "text": "So..."
  },
  {
   "start": 705.74,
   "end": 706.54,
   "text": "And then I called my mom"
  },
  {
   "start": 706.54,
   "end": 707.16,
   "text": "On the way back"
  },
  {
   "start": 707.16,
   "end": 707.56,
   "text": "And..."
  },
  {
   "start": 707.56,
   "end": 708.44,
   "text": "Because she mentioned"
  },
  {
   "start": 708.44,
   "end": 709.3,
   "text": "Calling me earlier"
  },
  {
   "start": 709.3,
   "end": 710.1,
   "text": "To offer me a pizza"
  },
  {
   "start": 710.1,
   "end": 711.28,
   "text": "So she was still out"
  },
  {
   "start": 711.28,
   "end": 711.62,
   "text": "For that."
  },
  {
   "start": 711.74,
   "end": 712.12,
   "text": "And she said,"
  },
  {
   "start": 712.2,
   "end": 712.4,
   "text": "Yeah,"
  },
  {
   "start": 712.46,
   "end": 713.96,
   "text": "I went over there"
  },
  {
   "start": 713.96,
   "end": 716.42,
   "text": "And, um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 716.42,
   "end": 717.86,
   "text": "Yeah, she made me"
  },
  {
   "start": 717.86,
   "end": 718.78,
   "text": "This big old salad"
  },
  {
   "start": 718.78,
   "end": 719.94,
   "text": "Like a really nice salad"
  },
  {
